  - pressure: 0
    title: Nutrition
    description: 'Full bellies, hollow bodies: a people living on one food lacks what
      varied crops and stores once gave. The Peach Sickness of The Inescapable Hunger
      begins here.'
    emergesAtPeople: 0
    fullAtPeople: 0
    emergenceTitle: Hunger of one crop
    emergenceNotice: 'The people number {people}: settled on what they store, they
      can now sicken from eating one food. Nutrition can wake; varied stores keep it
      away.'
    growthWeight: 0.6
    deathsPerSeventh: 0.0000396825
