    title: Disease Burden
    description: 'Sickness spreading among the people: crowded homes, the vectors
      that carry it and the waves of the Great Plague. In Arcanoria a disease exploits
      Resonance as much as flesh.'
    emergesAtPeople: 0
    fullAtPeople: 0
    emergenceTitle: Sickness takes root
